Description: Protects statistical tables using the native Tau-Argus
    engine and the HiGHS solver, both bundled in the distribution.
    Retains the high-level interface developed by INSEE; usage follows
    the original rtauargus package. Two differences from the original:
    no TauArgus.exe is required (cross-platform native engine), and
    audit() reports the realized bounds of a table, the native
    alternative to intervalle.exe.
